{"kind":"resource-field","id":"size","data":{"id":"size","label":{"en":"Dimensions and units","zh":"尺寸与单位","ru":"Размеры и единицы"},"hint":{"en":"State the required dimensions and units. Mark any dimensions that still need confirmation.","zh":"填写所需尺寸及单位，标注仍需确认的尺寸。","ru":"Укажите размеры и единицы измерения. Отметьте размеры, требующие согласования."}},"editable":["label.zh","label.en","label.ru","hint.zh","hint.en","hint.ru"],"baselineHash":"dd3dc523c96ad531d8ee9f69989024326cccba37efc7af1d2c613da62ce0c149"},{"kind":"resource-field","id":"structure","data":{"id":"structure","label":{"en":"Bag construction","zh":"袋型结构","ru":"Конструкция мешка"},"hint":{"en":"Describe openings, closures, liners or coating requirements. Attach an existing reference when available.","zh":"说明开口、封口、内袋或覆膜要求；如有现有样品，请说明参考信息。","ru":"Опишите отверстия, закрытие, вкладыш или покрытие. При наличии укажите образец для сравнения."}},"editable":["label.zh","label.en","label.ru","hint.zh","hint.en","hint.ru"],"baselineHash":"6f257c94923d9edbd3b6d1586b650e20c9f7d3bf8aa19c75c594f413cc5bf0ec"},{"kind":"resource-field","id":"load","data":{"id":"load","label":{"en":"Required load and checks","zh":"装载要求与验证项目","ru":"Нагрузка и проверки"},"hint":{"en":"State the intended load and any required testing. Performance and suitability require separate technical confirmation.","zh":"说明预期装载量与需要的测试。性能和适用性须另行技术确认。","ru":"Укажите предполагаемую нагрузку и необходимые испытания. Характеристики и пригодность согласуются отдельно."}},"editable":["label.zh","label.en","label.ru","hint.zh","hint.en","hint.ru"],"baselineHash":"de359c7e6b50d6a709af1099dbd98dbd73c9d70af4bdbdf9ab0af451741c19d5"},{"kind":"resource-field","id":"print","data":{"id":"print","label":{"en":"Printing requirements","zh":"印刷要求","ru":"Требования к печати"},"hint":{"en":"State the print sides, colours, reference design and whether artwork is ready. Do not include confidential artwork in this public checklist.","zh":"说明印刷面、颜色、设计参考及图稿准备情况。请勿在此公开清单中填写保密图稿内容。","ru":"Укажите стороны печати, цвета, образец дизайна и готовность макета. Не включайте конфиденциальные макеты в этот общедоступный список."}},"editable":["label.zh","label.en","label.ru","hint.zh","hint.en","hint.ru"],"baselineHash":"74b01248920fac4e21def95c79013b50dce98e88b3edf834e0f9da84aec59da7"},{"kind":"resource-field","id":"volume","data":{"id":"volume","label":{"en":"Quantity and delivery","zh":"数量与交付需求","ru":"Количество и поставка"},"hint":{"en":"State quantity, destination and desired delivery window. Availability, pricing and dates remain subject to review.","zh":"说明数量、目的地及期望交付时间。供货、价格和日期仍需确认。","ru":"Укажите количество, место назначения и желаемый срок. Наличие, цена и сроки подлежат согласованию."}},"editable":["label.zh","label.en","label.ru","hint.zh","hint.en","hint.ru"],"baselineHash":"763b697c41c536ebfec605f0d363e9ef3faecde17bfec1482fcf59dfc58873e6"},{"kind":"company-profile","id":"dongda-profile","data":{"schemaVersion":"2026.10.09-company-profile-v1","id":"dongda-profile","reviewStatus":"legacy-pending","provenance":{"source":"legacy-index-company","sourceSha256":"b1a470d3e660755f792f46059a44206c716eb19425477a3e4fea454445606bb3"},"copy":{"ab_h1":{"zh":"关于东大","en":"About DongDa","ru":"О компании DongDa","kk":"DongDa туралы","ky":"DongDa жөнүндө","tg":"Дар бораи DongDa","tk":"DongDa barada","uz":"DongDa haqida"},"ab_sub":{"zh":"东大（成立于1991年）已从传统制造企业完成向全球化供应链核心节点的战略转型。","en":"Since 1991, DongDa has evolved from a traditional manufacturer into a global industrial packaging supply chain platform, delivering end-to-end solutions across Eurasia.","ru":"DongDa (осн. 1991) завершила трансформацию от традиционного производителя к глобальному узлу цепочки поставок упаковки.","kk":"DongDa (1991 жылы құрылды) дәстүрлі өндірушіден жаһандық қаптама тізбегінің хабына айналды.","ky":"DongDa (1991-жылы негизделди) заманбап өндүрүүчүдөн дүйнөлүк жеткирүү тизмегинин хабына айланды.","tg":"DongDa (таъсис 1991) аз истеҳсолкунандаи анъанавӣ ба маркази ҷаҳонии занҷири таъминот табдил ёфт.","tk":"DongDa (1991) adaty öndürijiden dünýä üpjünçilik zynjyrynyň merkezine öwrüldi.","uz":"DongDa (1991) an\'anaviy ishlab chiqaruvchidan global ta\'minot zanjiri markaziga aylandi."},"ab_ey":{"zh":"企业概况","en":"Corporate Profile","ru":"О компании","kk":"Компания профилі","ky":"Компания профили","tg":"Профили ширкат","tk":"Kompaniýa profili","uz":"Kompaniya profili"},"ab_body":{"zh":"东大创立于1991年，温州/上海为全球指挥中心，汇聚3000余名行业精英，统筹核心技术研发与全球资本调配。在新疆阿克苏建有1000亩智能化生产基地，乌兹别克斯坦撒马尔罕设有BOXIN博新本地化工厂，哈萨克斯坦阿斯塔纳设立东大贸易区域服务中心。","en":"Founded in 1991, DongDa is headquartered in Wenzhou/Shanghai with a workforce of 3,000+. The Group operates Industry 4.0 smart factories in Xinjiang Aksu (China) and Samarkand (Uzbekistan, via subsidiary BOXIN), with a regional service centre in Astana, Kazakhstan (Dongda Trade). Recognised Tier-1 supplier to CUCC, Conch Cement, VICAT and other global cement leaders.","ru":"Основана в 1991 году. Штаб-квартира в Вэньчжоу/Шанхае (3000+ специалистов). Умные заводы в Аксу и Самарканде (BOXIN). Региональный хаб в Астане (Dongda Trade). Поставщик 1-го эшелона для CUCC, Conch, VICAT.","kk":"DongDa 1991 жылы құрылды. Штаб-пәтері Вэньчжоу/Шанхайда (3000+ маман). Аксу мен Самарқандта зауыттар (BOXIN). Астанадағы аймақтық хаб (Dongda Trade). CUCC, Conch, VICAT Tier 1 жеткізушісі.","ky":"DongDa 1991-жылы негизделди. Штаб-пәтери Вэньчжоу/Шанхайда. Аксу жана Самаркандда заводдор. CUCC, Conch, VICAT Tier 1 жеткирүүчүсү.","tg":"DongDa соли 1991 таъсис ёфт. Дафтари марказӣ Вэньчжоу/Шанхай. Заводҳо дар Аксу ва Самарқанд. Таъминкунандаи Tier 1 барои CUCC, Conch, VICAT.","tk":"DongDa 1991-nji ýylda esaslandyryldy. Merkezi Wenzhou/Şanhaý. Aksu we Samarkantta zawodlar. CUCC, Conch, VICAT Tier 1 üpjünçisi.","uz":"DongDa 1991-yilda tashkil etilgan. Shtab-kvartirasi Wenzhou/Shanxayda. Aksu va Samarqandda zavodlar. CUCC, Conch, VICAT Tier 1 ta\'minotchisi."},"ab_cap_e":{"zh":"核心能力","en":"Core Competencies","ru":"Ключевые компетенции","kk":"Негізгі құзыреттер","ky":"Негизги компетенциялар","tg":"Салоҳиятҳои асосӣ","tk":"Esasy ukyplar","uz":"Asosiy kompetensiyalar"},"company_atlas_ey":{"zh":"企业信息","en":"Company Information","ru":"Информация о компании","kk":"Company Information","ky":"Company Information","tg":"Company Information","tk":"Company Information","uz":"Company Information"},"company_atlas_h":{"zh":"围绕包装、材料与区域服务构建的制造集团","en":"A manufacturing group built around packaging, materials and regional service","ru":"Производственная группа вокруг упаковки, материалов и регионального сервиса","kk":"A manufacturing group built around packaging, materials and regional service","ky":"A manufacturing group built around packaging, materials and regional service","tg":"A manufacturing group built around packaging, materials and regional service","tk":"A manufacturing group built around packaging, materials and regional service","uz":"A manufacturing group built around packaging, materials and regional service"},"company_atlas_p":{"zh":"东大通过中国总部、新疆阿克苏、撒马尔罕和阿斯塔纳协同产品工程、智能制造与跨境交付。下方企业概况与发展历程帮助采购方在询价前理解产能、治理和长期可靠性。","en":"DongDa coordinates product engineering, smart manufacturing and cross-border delivery from China HQ, Xinjiang Aksu, Samarkand and Astana. The company profile and journey below help buyers understand capacity, governance and long-term reliability before requesting a quote.","ru":"DongDa координирует инженерию, умное производство и трансграничные поставки через штаб в Китае, Аксу, Самарканд и Астану. Профиль и история ниже помогают оценить мощность, управление и надёжность.","kk":"DongDa coordinates product engineering, smart manufacturing and cross-border delivery from China HQ, Xinjiang Aksu, Samarkand and Astana. The company profile and journey below help buyers understand capacity, governance and long-term reliability before requesting a quote.","ky":"DongDa coordinates product engineering, smart manufacturing and cross-border delivery from China HQ, Xinjiang Aksu, Samarkand and Astana. The company profile and journey below help buyers understand capacity, governance and long-term reliability before requesting a quote.","tg":"DongDa coordinates product engineering, smart manufacturing and cross-border delivery from China HQ, Xinjiang Aksu, Samarkand and Astana. The company profile and journey below help buyers understand capacity, governance and long-term reliability before requesting a quote.","tk":"DongDa coordinates product engineering, smart manufacturing and cross-border delivery from China HQ, Xinjiang Aksu, Samarkand and Astana. The company profile and journey below help buyers understand capacity, governance and long-term reliability before requesting a quote.","uz":"DongDa coordinates product engineering, smart manufacturing and cross-border delivery from China HQ, Xinjiang Aksu, Samarkand and Astana. The company profile and journey below help buyers understand capacity, governance and long-term reliability before requesting a quote."},"journey_ey":{"zh":"发展历程","en":"Company Journey","ru":"История компании","kk":"Company Journey","ky":"Company Journey","tg":"Company Journey","tk":"Company Journey","uz":"Company Journey"},"journey_h":{"zh":"从本地制造到欧亚供应链网络的四个阶段","en":"Four stages from local manufacturing to a Eurasian supply network","ru":"Четыре этапа от локального производства к евразийской сети","kk":"Four stages from local manufacturing to a Eurasian supply network","ky":"Four stages from local manufacturing to a Eurasian supply network","tg":"Four stages from local manufacturing to a Eurasian supply network","tk":"Four stages from local manufacturing to a Eurasian supply network","uz":"Four stages from local manufacturing to a Eurasian supply network"},"journey_1_t":{"zh":"工业基础","en":"Industrial foundation","ru":"Промышленная база","kk":"Industrial foundation","ky":"Industrial foundation","tg":"Industrial foundation","tk":"Industrial foundation","uz":"Industrial foundation"},"journey_1_p":{"zh":"从拉丝与塑编包装起步，逐步建立国内销售网络。","en":"Started from wire drawing and woven packaging, then expanded the domestic sales network.","ru":"Старт с вытяжки нити и тканой упаковки, затем развитие продаж в Китае.","kk":"Started from wire drawing and woven packaging, then expanded the domestic sales network.","ky":"Started from wire drawing and woven packaging, then expanded the domestic sales network.","tg":"Started from wire drawing and woven packaging, then expanded the domestic sales network.","tk":"Started from wire drawing and woven packaging, then expanded the domestic sales network.","uz":"Started from wire drawing and woven packaging, then expanded the domestic sales network."},"journey_2_t":{"zh":"规模化与多元化","en":"Scale and diversification","ru":"Масштаб и диверсификация","kk":"Scale and diversification","ky":"Scale and diversification","tg":"Scale and diversification","tk":"Scale and diversification","uz":"Scale and diversification"},"journey_2_p":{"zh":"建设更大生产基地，形成包装印刷、纺织和新材料能力。","en":"Built larger production bases, packaging printing, textile and new material capabilities.","ru":"Крупные базы, печать упаковки, текстиль и новые материалы.","kk":"Built larger production bases, packaging printing, textile and new material capabilities.","ky":"Built larger production bases, packaging printing, textile and new material capabilities.","tg":"Built larger production bases, packaging printing, textile and new material capabilities.","tk":"Built larger production bases, packaging printing, textile and new material capabilities.","uz":"Built larger production bases, packaging printing, textile and new material capabilities."},"journey_3_t":{"zh":"智能制造","en":"Smart manufacturing","ru":"Умное производство","kk":"Smart manufacturing","ky":"Smart manufacturing","tg":"Smart manufacturing","tk":"Smart manufacturing","uz":"Smart manufacturing"},"journey_3_p":{"zh":"推进包装文化、循环经济和智能化生产系统。","en":"Launched packaging culture, circular economy and intelligent production systems.","ru":"Культура упаковки, циркулярная экономика и интеллектуальные производственные сист